internal_name: PS_MONK1
name: Hero: Monk: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal d...
text: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal death awaits any who would seek to steal the treasure secured within this room. So speaks the Lord of Terror, and so it is written.

internal_name: PS_MONK8
name: Hero: Monk: Your death will be avenged.
text: Your death will be avenged.

internal_name: PS_MONK9
name: Hero: Monk: Rest in peace, my friend.
text: Rest in peace, my friend.

internal_name: PS_MONK10
name: Hero: Monk: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the hall...
text: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the hall of fire, valor awaits for the hero of light to awaken.

internal_name: PS_MONK11
name: Hero: Monk: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When...
text: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When you turn, they will be gone, whispering their hidden song. Then you see what cannot be. Shadows move where light should be. Out of darkness, out of mind, cast down into the halls of the blind.

internal_name: PS_MONK12
name: Hero: Monk: The armories of hell are home to the warlord of blood. In his...
text: The armories of hell are home to the warlord of blood. In his wake lay the mutilated bodies of thousands. Angels and men alike have been cut down to fulfill his endless sacrifices to the dark ones, who scream for one thing, blood.

internal_name: PS_MONK52
name: Hero: Monk: Yes, that is a cow, all right.
text: Yes, that is a cow, all right.

internal_name: PS_MONK54
name: Hero: Monk: In Spiritus Sanctum.
text: In Spiritus Sanctum.

internal_name: PS_MONK55
name: Hero: Monk: Predictum Otium.
text: Predictum Otium.

internal_name: PS_MONK56
name: Hero: Monk: Ephesio obitus ut inimicus.
text: Ephesio obitus ut inimicus.

internal_name: PS_MONK61
name: Hero: Monk: I am not impressed.
text: I am not impressed.

internal_name: PS_MONK62
name: Hero: Monk: I am sorry. Did I break your concentration?
text: I am sorry. Did I break your concentration?

internal_name: PS_MONK80
name: Hero: Monk: The spirits of the dead are now avenged.
text: The spirits of the dead are now avenged.

internal_name: PS_MONK82
name: Hero: Monk: Rest well, Loric. I'll find your son.
text: Rest well, Loric. I'll find your son.

internal_name: PS_MONK83
name: Hero: Monk: Your madness ends here, betrayer.
text: Your madness ends here, betrayer.

internal_name: PS_MONK87
name: Hero: Monk: This must be what Griswold wanted.
text: This must be what Griswold wanted.

internal_name: PS_MONK88
name: Hero: Monk: I need to get this to locked on in.
text: I need to get this to locked on in.

internal_name: PS_MONK89
name: Hero: Monk: I need to get this to Griswold.
text: I need to get this to Griswold.

internal_name: PS_MONK91
name: Hero: Monk: May the spirit of Arcane protect me.
text: May the spirit of Arcane protect me.

internal_name: PS_MONK92
name: Hero: Monk: This is a place of great power.
text: This is a place of great power.

internal_name: PS_MONK94
name: Hero: Monk: Your reign of pain has ended.
text: Your reign of pain has ended.

internal_name: PS_MONK95
name: Hero: Monk: Now that is a big mushroom.
text: Now that is a big mushroom.

internal_name: PS_MONK96
name: Hero: Monk: The smell of death surrounds me.
text: The smell of death surrounds me.

internal_name: PS_MONK97
name: Hero: Monk: The sanctity of this place has been fouled.
text: The sanctity of this place has been fouled.

internal_name: PS_MONK98
name: Hero: Monk: It is hot down here.
text: It is hot down here.

internal_name: PS_MONK99
name: Hero: Monk: I must be getting close.
text: I must be getting close.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE1
name: Hero: Rogue: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal d...
text: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal death awaits any who would seek to steal the treasures secured within this room. So speaks the Lord of Terror, and so it is written.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE2
name: Hero: Rogue: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden plac...
text: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden place. Return from whence you came and your life will be spared. Horazon, master of the disciplines that summon and bind creatures to this plane, promises death to those who pass beyond the five pillars. You have been admonished.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE3
name: Hero: Rogue: Then by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given l...
text: Then by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given life. Sounds like a spell of some kind.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE4
name: Hero: Rogue: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Should be interesting reading.
text: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Should be interesting reading.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE5
name: Hero: Rogue: Morta Vespa, Gaia Inumino, Evegin Jatan Luagratan.
text: Morta Vespa, Gaia Inumino, Evegin Jatan Luagratan.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE6
name: Hero: Rogue: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this d...
text: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this demon, for his strength appears immeasurable. Reading the scroll, and therefore speaking his name, near an arcane circle of binding will surely summon him there. Hmm, near a circle of binding, eh?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE7
name: Hero: Rogue: It seems that I may have brought something into this plane th...
text: It seems that I may have brought something into this plane that even I cannot control. The creature that fell into my astral trap is a very deadly demon. I've been able to bind it at the bottom of a pit, but it kills everything that I've sent there in attempts to defeat it. While it cannot escape, it does block the tunnels that lead to my protected haven. I am tempted to use the switch to open the tunnels to see if it will just leave, sir, demons I have trapped before. If I could just lure it somewhere else.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE8
name: Hero: Rogue: Your death will be avenged.
text: Your death will be avenged.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE9
name: Hero: Rogue: Rest in peace, my friend.
text: Rest in peace, my friend.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE10
name: Hero: Rogue: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the hall...
text: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the hall of fire, valor awaits for the hero of light to awaken.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE11
name: Hero: Rogue: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When...
text: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When you turn, they will be gone, whispering their hidden song. Then you see what cannot be. Shadows move where light should be. Out of darkness, out of mind, cast down into the halls of the blind.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE12
name: Hero: Rogue: The armories of hell are home to the warlord of blood. In his...
text: The armories of hell are home to the warlord of blood. In his wake lay the mutilated bodies of thousands. Angels and man alike have been cut down to fulfill his endless sacrifices to the dark ones, who scream for one thing, blood.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE13
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't use this yet.
text: I can't use this yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE14
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't carry anymore.
text: I can't carry anymore.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE15
name: Hero: Rogue: I have no room.
text: I have no room.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE16
name: Hero: Rogue: Now where would I put this?
text: Now where would I put this?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE17
name: Hero: Rogue: No way.
text: No way.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE18
name: Hero: Rogue: Not a chance.
text: Not a chance.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE19
name: Hero: Rogue: I would never use this.
text: I would never use this.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE20
name: Hero: Rogue: I'd have to equip that.
text: I'd have to equip that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE21
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't move this.
text: I can't move this.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE22
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't move this, yet.
text: I can't move this, yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE23
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't open this.
text: I can't open this.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE24
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't open this, yet.
text: I can't open this, yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE25
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't lift this.
text: I can't lift this.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE26
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't lift this, yet.
text: I can't lift this, yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE27
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't cast that here.
text: I can't cast that here.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE28
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't cast that. Yet.
text: I can't cast that. Yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE29
name: Hero: Rogue: That didn't do anything.
text: That didn't do anything.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE30
name: Hero: Rogue: I can already do that.
text: I can already do that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE31
name: Hero: Rogue: I don't need that.
text: I don't need that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE32
name: Hero: Rogue: I don't need to do that.
text: I don't need to do that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE33
name: Hero: Rogue: I don't want that.
text: I don't want that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE34
name: Hero: Rogue: I don't have a spell ready.
text: I don't have a spell ready.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE35
name: Hero: Rogue: Not enough manna.
text: Not enough manna.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE36
name: Hero: Rogue: That would kill me.
text: That would kill me.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE37
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't do that.
text: I can't do that.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE38
name: Hero: Rogue: No.
text: No.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE39
name: Hero: Rogue: Yes!
text: Yes!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE40
name: Hero: Rogue: That won't work.
text: That won't work.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE41
name: Hero: Rogue: That won't work here.
text: That won't work here.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE42
name: Hero: Rogue: That won't work yet.
text: That won't work yet.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE43
name: Hero: Rogue: I can't get there from here.
text: I can't get there from here.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE44
name: Hero: Rogue: It's too heavy.
text: It's too heavy.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE45
name: Hero: Rogue: That's too big.
text: That's too big.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE46
name: Hero: Rogue: Ah, just what I was looking for.
text: Ah, just what I was looking for.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE47
name: Hero: Rogue: I've got a bad feeling about this.
text: I've got a bad feeling about this.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE48
name: Hero: Rogue: Got milk?
text: Got milk?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE49
name: Hero: Rogue: I'm not thirsty.
text: I'm not thirsty.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE50
name: Hero: Rogue: Hey, I'm no milkmaid.
text: Hey, I'm no milkmaid.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE51
name: Hero: Rogue: Hey, I could blow up the whole village.
text: Hey, I could blow up the whole village.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE52
name: Hero: Rogue: Yep, that's a cow, all right.
text: Yep, that's a cow, all right.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE53
name: Hero: Rogue: Too... heavy.
text: Too... heavy.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE54
name: Hero: Rogue: In spiritu sanctum.
text: In spiritu sanctum.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE55
name: Hero: Rogue: Predictum Otium.
text: Predictum Otium.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE56
name: Hero: Rogue: Ephesio orbitus ut inimicus.
text: Ephesio orbitus ut inimicus.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE57
name: Hero: Rogue: The enchantment is gone.
text: The enchantment is gone.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE58
name: Hero: Rogue: All too easy.
text: All too easy.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE59
name: Hero: Rogue: Back to the grave.
text: Back to the grave.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE60
name: Hero: Rogue: Time to die.
text: Time to die.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE61
name: Hero: Rogue: I'm not impressed.
text: I'm not impressed.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE62
name: Hero: Rogue: I'm sorry. Did I break your concentration?
text: I'm sorry. Did I break your concentration?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE63
name: Hero: Rogue: Vengeance is mine.
text: Vengeance is mine.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE64
name: Hero: Rogue: Die.
text: Die.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE65
name: Hero: Rogue: Yeah.
text: Yeah.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE66
name: Hero: Rogue: Ah.
text: Ah.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE67
name: Hero: Rogue: Phew.
text: Phew.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE68
name: Hero: Rogue: Ah!
text: Ah!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE69
name: Hero: Rogue: Ah!
text: Ah!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE69B
name: Hero: Rogue: Oh!
text: Oh!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE70
name: Hero: Rogue: Ugh!
text: Ugh!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE71
name: Hero: Rogue: AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH
text: AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH

internal_name: PS_ROGUE72
name: Hero: Rogue: Ah! Ah!
text: Ah! Ah!

internal_name: PS_ROGUE73
name: Hero: Rogue: Oh.
text: Oh.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE74
name: Hero: Rogue: Whoa.
text: Whoa.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE75
name: Hero: Rogue: Thank the light.
text: Thank the light.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE76
name: Hero: Rogue: What was that?
text: What was that?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE77
name: Hero: Rogue: Hmm?
text: Hmm?

internal_name: PS_ROGUE78
name: Hero: Rogue: Hmm.
text: Hmm.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE79
name: Hero: Rogue: Aha.
text: Aha.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE80
name: Hero: Rogue: The spirits of the dead are now avenged.
text: The spirits of the dead are now avenged.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE81
name: Hero: Rogue: The town is safe from these foul spawn.
text: The town is safe from these foul spawn.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE82
name: Hero: Rogue: Rest well, Leoric. I'll find your son.
text: Rest well, Leoric. I'll find your son.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE83
name: Hero: Rogue: Your madness ends here, betrayer.
text: Your madness ends here, betrayer.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE84
name: Hero: Rogue: You'll lure no more men to their deaths.
text: You'll lure no more men to their deaths.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE85
name: Hero: Rogue: Return to heaven, warrior of light.
text: Return to heaven, warrior of light.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE86
name: Hero: Rogue: I can see why they fear this weapon.
text: I can see why they fear this weapon.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE87
name: Hero: Rogue: This must be what Griswold wanted.
text: This must be what Griswold wanted.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE88
name: Hero: Rogue: I need to get this to Lakhdanen.
text: I need to get this to Lakhdanen.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE89
name: Hero: Rogue: I need to get this to Griswold.
text: I need to get this to Griswold.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE90
name: Hero: Rogue: I've never been here before.
text: I've never been here before.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE91
name: Hero: Rogue: May the spirit of Arcane protect me.
text: May the spirit of Arcane protect me.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE92
name: Hero: Rogue: This is a place of great power.
text: This is a place of great power.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE93
name: Hero: Rogue: This blade must be destroyed.
text: This blade must be destroyed.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE94
name: Hero: Rogue: Your reign of pain has ended.
text: Your reign of pain has ended.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE95
name: Hero: Rogue: Now that is a big mushroom.
text: Now that is a big mushroom.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE96
name: Hero: Rogue: The smell of death surrounds me.
text: The smell of death surrounds me.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE97
name: Hero: Rogue: The sanctity of this place has been fouled.
text: The sanctity of this place has been fouled.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE98
name: Hero: Rogue: It's hot down here.
text: It's hot down here.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE99
name: Hero: Rogue: I must be getting close.
text: I must be getting close.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE100
name: Hero: Rogue: Maybe it's locked from the inside.
text: Maybe it's locked from the inside.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE101
name: Hero: Rogue: Looks like it's rusted shut.
text: Looks like it's rusted shut.

internal_name: PS_ROGUE102
name: Hero: Rogue: Maybe there's another way.
text: Maybe there's another way.

internal_name: PS_MAGE1
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal d...
text: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal death awaits any who would seek to steal the treasure secured within this room. So speaks the Lord of Terror. And so it is written.

internal_name: PS_MAGE2
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden plac...
text: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden place. Return from whence you came, and your life will be spared. Horazon, master of the disciplines that summon and bind creatures to this plane, promises death to those who pass beyond the Five Pillars. You have been admonished.

internal_name: PS_MAGE3
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Then, by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given...
text: Then, by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given life. This sounds like a spell of some kind.

internal_name: PS_MAGE4
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Hmm. Should be interesting...
text: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Hmm. Should be interesting reading.

internal_name: PS_MAGE5
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Morta, Vespa, Gaia, Innúmino, Evigin, Jatan, Lua, Gretan.
text: Morta, Vespa, Gaia, Innúmino, Evigin, Jatan, Lua, Gretan.

internal_name: PS_MAGE6
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this d...
text: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this demon, for his strength appears immeasurable. Reading this scroll, and therefore speaking his name, near an arcane circle of binding will surely summon him there. Hmm. Near a circle of binding, eh?

internal_name: PS_MAGE7
name: Hero: Sorcerer: This looks like some sort of journal. It seems that I may hav...
text: This looks like some sort of journal. It seems that I may have brought something into this plane that even I cannot control. The creature that fell into my astral trap is a very deadly demon. I have been able to bind it at the bottom of a pit, but it kills everything that I have sent there in attempts to defeat it. While it cannot escape, it does block the tunnels that lead to my protected haven. I don't know if it will just leave, but I fear it is smarter than most of the lesser demons I have trapped before. If I could just lure it somewhere else.

internal_name: PS_MAGE8
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Your death will be avenged!
text: Your death will be avenged!

internal_name: PS_MAGE9
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Rest in peace, my friend.
text: Rest in peace, my friend.

internal_name: PS_MAGE10
name: Hero: Sorcerer: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the Hall...
text: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the Hall of Fire, valor awaits for the Hero of Light to awaken.

internal_name: PS_MAGE11
name: Hero: Sorcerer: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When...
text: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When you turn, they will be gone, whispering their hidden song. Then you see what cannot be. Shadows move where light should be. Out of darkness, out of mind. Cast down into the halls of the blind.

internal_name: PS_MAGE12
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The armories of hell are home to the Warlord of Blood. In his...
text: The armories of hell are home to the Warlord of Blood. In his wake lay the mutilated bodies of thousands. Angels and men alike have been cut down to fulfill his endless sacrifices to the Dark Ones, who scream for one thing. Blood.

internal_name: PS_MAGE13
name: Hero: Sorcerer: I cannot use this yet.
text: I cannot use this yet.

internal_name: PS_MAGE14
name: Hero: Sorcerer: I cannot carry any more.
text: I cannot carry any more.

internal_name: PS_MAGE15
name: Hero: Sorcerer: I have no room.
text: I have no room.

internal_name: PS_MAGE16
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Where would I put this?
text: Where would I put this?

internal_name: PS_MAGE17
name: Hero: Sorcerer: No way.
text: No way.

